entry.summary:
Marty from VTeacher here!
For AI-based security checks, if you are not working in a monorepo, Claude Code with Agent Team is quite handy. It can discover security holes that span across repositories, such as between the frontend and backend.
.claude/settings.local.json




{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS": "1"
  }
}

At this point, some people may be thinking, "Wait, that Einstein!?" So from here on, I mean the scientist Albert Einstein. Incidentally, the Japanese comedy duo Einstein appears to have no connection to the scientist in the origin of their name.
Einstein's theory of relativity taught us that time passes differently depending on one's frame of reference, and that strong gravity distorts space itself. I think this theory can also be applied to the world of…
